  m_Name: Slide_47_Mech_AiModels
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Project.Runtime::DumyatRuntime.TextSlideSO
  _sectionNumber: 6
  _sectionName: Mechanics
  _title: "Merchant AI \xB7 the models"
  _kicker: Every type is a pool sorted by priority, so a provider that fails falls
    through to the next.
  _speakerNotes: 
  _titleEffects: 0
  _kickerEffects: 0
  _background: {fileID: 0}
  _transitionIn: {fileID: 0}
  _layout: 3
  _posterTreatment: 0
  _body: 
  _bullets:
  - "Language \u2014 Gemini gemini-3.1-flash-lite at priority 10, falling back to
    Groq llama-3.3-70b-versatile at 1."
  - "Speech in \u2014 Munsit Realtime at priority 10, tuned for Egyptian Arabic,
    falling back to ElevenLabs Scribe v2 at 0."
  - "Speech out \u2014 ElevenLabs eleven_flash_v2_5. The only type with no second
    option: if it fails the line is shown, not spoken."
  - "Swapping a provider is a priority number in the Inspector, not a code change
    \u2014 the managers only ever ask for the highest-priority model that reports
    itself available."
  - 'The thresholds are game constants, not model settings: accept at 70, confirm
    at 55, and the same pair mirrored for walking away.'
  _readouts:
  - Label: LLM
    Value: gemini-3.1-flash-lite
    Positive: 0
  - Label: Speech in
    Value: Munsit Realtime
    Positive: 0
  - Label: Speech out
    Value: eleven_flash_v2_5
    Positive: 0
